{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000000333","bookName":"Nuestro amor no tiene cura","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000000333/42000000333.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":6206018,"followCount":80472,"introduction":"Sara Villas descubrió que su esposo tenía un romance con su secretaria, Josefa Quijas. Para humillarla, él colmó a Josefa de joyas y la llevó a eventos de la alta sociedad. En una subasta, Sara intentó comprar un inhibidor, pero su esposo creyó que ella estaba enferma, la insultó y rompió el objeto. Entonces, Sara le mostró un informe médico y, con una sonrisa, reveló que la verdadera enferma era Josefa.","chapterCount":70,"labels":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"tags":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"typeTwoIds":[335],"typeTwoNames":["Venganza"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":335,"name":"Venganza","replaceName":"venganza"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Venganza","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Nuestro-amor-no-tiene-cura","bookNameLower":"nuestro-amor-no-tiene-cura","shelfTime":"2025-11-12 18:50:02","firstShelfTime":"2025-11-12 18:50:02","performerList":[{"performerId":"21113","performerName":"Linmiao Cheng","performerFormatName":"Linmiao-Cheng","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/3x1/21113/21113.jpg?time=1784786911761","videoCount":10},{"performerId":"28909","performerName":"Zhongqi Liang","performerFormatName":"Zhongqi-Liang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x0/28909/28909.jpg?time=1785991268348","videoCount":2}],"performerIdList":[21113,28909]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700021139","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/93/3x3/33x3/333x0/33300000024/700021139_1/700021139.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795197600&Signature=fpnQUn9MROipjONahaIB2K0ouyyacR1zVIm7ABu7jKsdbG1mEmzQ8lWm~8VW738BxrPHw2UqHQEp2HhTbwiqflUpeIjEKbx2zRGcKBC49lclzWcWjzMAa~MJgLU~bZcYHQnhkZvK9jonYg3FyKdylz7Oye5hzJYQqPCXR0Or44cCph5prgbu2-oUakYOej83sjwK6fsFxacHMl7Zag9NM